        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>しんごうは　あか あお よくみて　<i>コワシ</i>ましょう</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(Look carefully at the red and blue signals, and <i>DESTROY </i>them)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's an eccentric action puzzle game where you destroy blocks modeled after pedestrian traffic lights.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Basic rules</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3506550/extras/e378fb73d5a2e1caf91ad4e0ba650b2a.poster.avif?t=1761564080\" width=256 height=160 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3506550/extras/e378fb73d5a2e1caf91ad4e0ba650b2a.webm?t=1761564080\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3506550/extras/e378fb73d5a2e1caf91ad4e0ba650b2a.mp4?t=1761564080\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Signal blocks&quot; will appear on the board. They can be moved vertically or horizontally.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Vertical blocks can only be moved vertically, and horizontal blocks can only be moved horizontally.</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3506550/extras/5a2526962aa4ce3e2a89eebfb9fad54b.poster.avif?t=1761564080\" width=256 height=160 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3506550/extras/5a2526962aa4ce3e2a89eebfb9fad54b.webm?t=1761564080\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When two or more signals of the same color touch each other, the blocks will explode.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Signal blocks in contact to the explosion will change their color due to the shock. When this creates matching colors in sequence, it forms a chain and will continue exploding.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Playable modes</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ENDLESS : Earn score until game over.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >STAGE : Destroy a targeted number of blocks on the board of various shapes.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >TIME LIMIT : Reach hi-score within the time by chain destruction.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SCORE RACE : Compete by the time taken to earn a target score.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >BATTLE : Can compete offline with one PC.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each mode has EASY, NORMAL, and HARD courses, so you can play at a difficulty level that matches your skill.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >----------------------------------------------------------</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is a work of fiction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Destroying traffic lights in real life is prohibited by law.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >----------------------------------------------------------</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>しんごうは　あか あお よくみて　<i>コワシ</i>ましょう</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(Look carefully at the red and blue signals, and <i>DESTROY </i>them)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's an eccentric action puzzle game where you destroy blocks modeled after pedestrian traffic lights.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Basic rules</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3506550/extras/e378fb73d5a2e1caf91ad4e0ba650b2a.poster.avif?t=1761564080\" width=256 height=160 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3506550/extras/e378fb73d5a2e1caf91ad4e0ba650b2a.webm?t=1761564080\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3506550/extras/e378fb73d5a2e1caf91ad4e0ba650b2a.mp4?t=1761564080\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Signal blocks&quot; will appear on the board. They can be moved vertically or horizontally.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Vertical blocks can only be moved vertically, and horizontal blocks can only be moved horizontally.</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3506550/extras/5a2526962aa4ce3e2a89eebfb9fad54b.poster.avif?t=1761564080\" width=256 height=160 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3506550/extras/5a2526962aa4ce3e2a89eebfb9fad54b.webm?t=1761564080\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When two or more signals of the same color touch each other, the blocks will explode.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Signal blocks in contact to the explosion will change their color due to the shock. When this creates matching colors in sequence, it forms a chain and will continue exploding.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Playable modes</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ENDLESS : Earn score until game over.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >STAGE : Destroy a targeted number of blocks on the board of various shapes.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >TIME LIMIT : Reach hi-score within the time by chain destruction.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SCORE RACE : Compete by the time taken to earn a target score.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >BATTLE : Can compete offline with one PC.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each mode has EASY, NORMAL, and HARD courses, so you can play at a difficulty level that matches your skill.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >----------------------------------------------------------</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is a work of fiction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Destroying traffic lights in real life is prohibited by law.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >----------------------------------------------------------</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
